1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,423
Man: This is Jimmy Clarkin from Rise Bakery calling.

2
00:00:04,423 --> 00:00:13,270
I received a message that you'd like to do a story about my shop for your university newspaper.

3
00:00:13,270 --> 00:00:18,240
Woman: Yes, you've been a staple in our city for generations now.

4
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:23,040
The grandparents of our current students were customers there when they were young.

5
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:26,940
Man: It's a family owned business and we're proud of it

6
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:30,140
Would you be able to come next Monday at 3 o'clock?

7
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:35,000
Woman: Definitely. Is it all right if my photographer comes along?

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,500
Man: Of course you can get different shots

9
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:42,250
even back in our kitchen where we do all the baking.
